From 31ae34bc6a8bff8fa4ddafe91944d58e64fc2f7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:03:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] up: null-pointer-slots

Source: 688c6fa7d8
Switch: EDEN_UP_NULL_POINTER_SLOTS
T61 legacy EDEN_NX2_NULL_SLOTS remains available. New path seeds earlier pointers, serializes rebuilt environments and chooses disk records with more bindings. Retired pipelines retained for in-flight users.
---
